cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or model in your research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "SethSightVision2: ESP32-CAM Live Detection and ViT Fabric Classification"
authors:
  - family-names: "Caguete"
    given-names: "Justine Clarke"
    # orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0000-0000-0000"   # add once you have an ORCID
    # email: "your-email@example.com"
    # affiliation: "Your School / Institution"
repository-code: "https://github.com/negussmr/SethSightVision2"
url: "https://github.com/negussmr/SethSightVision2"
abstract: >-
  SethSightVision2 combines an ESP32-CAM live-video pipeline with real-time
  YOLO object detection, and a fabric classifier (cotton, denim, linen, silk,
  wool) built by fine-tuning a Vision Transformer (ViT-Base, patch 16, 224x224,
  ImageNet-21k pre-trained) on Roboflow. Roboflow model ID:
  seth-caguete/fabric-reference-library-5-vit-base-patch16-224-in21k-t2
  (dataset version 5, training run 2).
keywords:
  - fabric classification
  - image classification
  - vision transformer
  - ESP32-CAM
  - YOLO
  - Roboflow
  - computer vision
